 *     neighbourhood  index  bit of 30  output
 *     111            7      0          0
 *     110            6      0          0
 *     101            5      0          0
 *     100            4      1          1
 *     011            3      1          1
 *     010            2      1          1
 *     001            1      1          1
 *     000            0      0          0
